1
00:00:00,033 --> 00:00:03,573
(Howard:)He was just wondering
if he wore skintight jeans and a tank top...

2
00:00:03,745 --> 00:00:06,745
(Howard:)...if he'd get his shrimp lo mein for free.

3
00:00:08,249 --> 00:00:11,459
(Penny:)What are you saying?
That I'm using my body to get dinner?

4
00:00:11,628 --> 00:00:14,128
That I'm some sort of
Chinese food prostitute?

5
00:00:16,674 --> 00:00:19,134
(Howard:)Yeah, Raj, what are you saying?

6
00:00:19,302 --> 00:00:22,092
(Penny:)Let me tell you something,
I pay my own way in this world.

7
00:00:22,263 --> 00:00:23,593
(Penny:)I don't rely on anybody.

8
00:00:30,104 --> 00:00:32,354
- What was that about?
- He has a nervous bladder...

9
00:00:32,524 --> 00:00:34,734
(Howard:)...when he's stressed out.

10
00:00:35,818 --> 00:00:38,028
(Howard:)Kind of like a puppy.

11
00:00:39,781 --> 00:00:42,951
Here, Leonard. Ten, 11, uh, 12... $14.

12
00:00:43,952 --> 00:00:46,122
It's 14.50, but it's okay.

13
00:00:47,413 --> 00:00:49,083
(Sheldon:)Oh, good. Dinner's here.

14
00:00:49,249 --> 00:00:51,669
(Penny:)Yes, dinner's here.
And I'm having takeout food.

15
00:00:51,834 --> 00:00:53,464
(Penny:)- Okay.
- You're damn right it's okay.

16
00:00:53,628 --> 00:00:57,878
I've been having leftovers for four days and
I wanted something different. So sue me.

17
00:00:58,049 --> 00:01:03,019
(Sheldon:)Forgive me, Penny, but that would be
the very definition of a frivolous lawsuit.

